, evidence-backed issues, and the canonical browser report. This read-only endpoint does not launch a scan.\"}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-4 font-mono text-sm dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"curl \\\"https://is-agentic.com/api/v1/report?url=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.com\\\"\"}]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"Read the complete request and response schema in the\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"className\":\"text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400\",\"href\":\"/openapi.json\",\"children\":\"Is Agentic OpenAPI description\"}],\". Discover the API portfolio through the\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"className\":\"text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400\",\"href\":\"/.well-known/api-catalog\",\"children\":\"RFC 9727 API catalog\"}],\".\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"20:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"errors\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Structured errors\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"Every documented report API error and every scan failure returned before streaming uses RFC 9457 problem details with\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\" application/problem+json\"}],\". Responses include a stable\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\" code\"}],\", human-readable \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"detail\"}],\", and a concrete\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"resolution\"}],\" hint. Unknown API routes and methods return the same shape instead of an HTML error page.\"]}],[\"$\",\"dl\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 grid gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"invalid-url\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"invalid_url\"}],\" · 400\"]}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Pass a public HTTP or HTTPS URL.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"report-not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"report_not_found\"}],\" · 404\"]}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Run the linked scan, then retry after completion.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"method-not-allowed\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"method_not_allowed\"}],\" · 405\"]}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Use the documented read-only GET operation.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"rate-limit-exceeded\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"rate_limit_exceeded\"}],\" · 429\"]}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"Honor \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"Retry-After\"}],\" before retrying.\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"report-temporarily-unavailable\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"report_temporarily_unavailable\"}],\" · 503\"]}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Retry shortly without launching a new scan.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"api-route-not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"api_route_not_found\"}],\" · 404\"]}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Use OpenAPI or the API catalog to recover.\"}]]}]]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"21:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"rate-limits\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Rate limits\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"The report API allows 120 requests per client IP in each 60-second window. Responses advertise the policy and current quota through the current IETF \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"RateLimit-Policy\"}],\" and \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"RateLimit\"}],\"structured fields, with compatibility fields for older clients. A 429 response also includes \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"Retry-After\"}],\".\"]}]}]]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"versioning-and-deprecation\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Versioning and deprecation\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"Stable REST operations use a major version in the URL, beginning with\",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\" /api/v1\"}],\". Backward-compatible fields may be added within v1; breaking request or response changes require a new major path. Before removing a stable version, Is Agentic will publish a migration guide and signal deprecation with RFC 9745 \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"Deprecation\"}],\"and \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"Link\"}],\" headers. A dated \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"Sunset\"}],\" header will be announced at least 90 days before removal.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"The unversioned \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"/api/report\"}],\" route remains available as a deprecated compatibility alias. No sunset is currently scheduled; new integrations should use \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"/api/v1/report\"}],\".\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"23:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"authentication-and-write-operations\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Authentication, webhooks, and writes\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"The documented JSON API and MCP tool are public and read-only. They require no API key or OAuth flow, expose no credentials, and do not provide writes, webhooks, or event subscriptions. Start a new scan on the \",[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"className\":\"text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400\",\"href\":\"/\",\"children\":\"Is Agentic home page\"}],\", then use these interfaces after the report completes.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":\"Because the API exposes one read-only resource and no collection, write, or long-running operation, pagination, Idempotency-Key, and asynchronous-job conventions do not apply. The OpenAPI description is the supported language-neutral integration contract; the official CLI is the maintained command-line client.\"}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"24:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"cli\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"CLI\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\"children\":[\"Retrieve the latest completed report from a terminal with the\",\" \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"text-inherit underline decoration-neutral-400 underline-offset-4 hover:decoration-neutral-900 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-600 dark:decoration-neutral-600 dark:hover:decoration-neutral-100 dark:focus-visible:outline-blue-400\",\"href\":\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/is-agentic\",\"children\":\"official is-agentic package on npm\"}],\". The command calls the same read-only public API, renders a compact terminal score with every failed or partial finding, and returns a stored report immediately. When no completed report exists, it starts a scan and waits for the stored result. Add \",[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"--json\"}],\" for the unchanged API response and structured error objects suitable for agents and scripts.\"]}],[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"className\":\"overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 p-4 font-mono text-sm dark:border-neutral-800 dark:bg-neutral-950\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"children\":\"npx is-agentic \u003cdomain\u003e\\nnpx is-agentic \u003cdomain\u003e --json\"}]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"25:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"mcp\",\"className\":\"grid scroll-mt-8 gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0 text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"MCP server\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-3 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"m-0\",\